[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13023.11, "timestamp": "03:37:03", "text": "对吧？ 对于即将"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13026.389, "timestamp": "03:37:06", "text": "开始的直播，我想他们可能会放一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13029.349, "timestamp": "03:37:09", "text": "YouTube 链接，但通常情况下，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13032.71, "timestamp": "03:37:12", "text": "如果是日程安排之类的，他们会放 Twitter 链接，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13034.71, "timestamp": "03:37:14", "text": "例如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13038.469, "timestamp": "03:37:18", "text": "Twitch 的直播，我们会问“这是在 Twitch 上吗？”，哦，这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13043.269, "timestamp": "03:37:23", "text": "是 Ian，好的，这是 Twitch 吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13045.349, "timestamp": "03:37:25", "text": "这是 ID，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13053.99, "timestamp": "03:37:33", "text": "等等。 这个。 是的，Twitch 也是如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13056.55, "timestamp": "03:37:36", "text": "。 所以，我的东西应该可以在 Twitch、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13061.269, "timestamp": "03:37:41", "text": "YouTube 和 Kick 上播放。 嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13063.75, "timestamp": "03:37:43", "text": "所以，我受到了启发。 所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13066.07, "timestamp": "03:37:46", "text": "就想，我要做这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13068.79, "timestamp": "03:37:48", "text": "Niji 的 Sanji 也是一样。 他们收到的都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13071.51, "timestamp": "03:37:51", "text": "同一个人做的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13074.469, "timestamp": "03:37:54", "text": "呃，他们有一个叫比利比利的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13077.83, "timestamp": "03:37:57", "text": "我直播的时候也用同样的设置"}]